@startuml
title 登录时序图
actor User
User -> web_server : 请求 /login
web_server -> login: 处理请求
login -> request: 获取请求数据
activate login
request -> login: 获取数据
login -> session: 获取session信息
activate session
session --> login: 返回session信息
login -> User: 获取用户信息
activate User
User --> login: 返回用户信息
login -> jsonify: 序列化数据
deactivate login
jsonify -> web_server: 返回响应
web_server -> User: 返回响应
activate web_server
User --> web_server: 返回响应
deactivate User
deactivate web_server
@enduml
